ment and support from so many kind players,<br>we managed to endure the darkest period and slowly see the game\u2019s reputation begin to rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still far from perfect, but we\u2019re continuously working to make it better,<br>and the H-content keeps improving as well.<br>We hope you\u2019ll enjoy this little adult game that fell to rock bottom and is now slowly climbing back up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0<br> \u00a0<br>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Boss Battles</strong>: Jump straight into the action with no filler stages, focusing entirely on reading attacks and mastering timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Boss Is Unique</strong>: Distinct weapons, combat rhythms, and attack patterns\u2014no two fights are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Intensity Combat System</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Block / Dodge</strong>: The foundation for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Counterattack / Perfect Parry</strong>: Reverse the situation with precision timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stagger \u2192 Combo \u2192 Execution</strong>: Break their guard, unleash a full assault, and finish them off.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adult Defeat Options</strong>: Upon losing, choose between standing back up to fight again or entering a fully animated, explicit sex battle with the victorious boss\u2014drawn from <strong>187 high-quality 3D H animations</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters &amp; Unlocks</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful, Alluring Female Bosses</strong>: Each is designed with a distinct appearance, personality, and fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Outfits &amp; Customization</strong>: Earn <strong>new outfits</strong> by defeating bosses, then freely mix and match every clothing part for complete customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory Shards</strong>: Claim a <strong>Memory Shard</strong> after each victory to unlock deeper parts of the story and uncover the truth of the trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>187 High-Quality 3D H Animations</strong>: Explicit post-defeat scenes are fully 3D animated and voice-acted, offering a wide variety of sexual interactions unique to each boss.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You\u2019ll Experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clear and rewarding gameplay loop: <strong>Learn patterns \u2192 Break stagger \u2192 Execute \u2192 Unlock outfits &amp; story</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss fight offers new mechanics, pacing, and visual designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The freedom to choose your post-defeat path\u2014jump straight back into the fight or enjoy one of the game\u2019s <strong>187 premium 3D H animations</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full outfit customization: freely combine any unlocked clothing parts to create your own unique look.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains explicit sexual content, including 187 fully animated 3D sex scenes with the bosses, and a full outfit customization system. All characters are over 20.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u232cThe heroine features multiple personas, including a priestess, fox spirit, queen, barbarian, ninja, martial artist, and general.\u232c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771570/extras/2a63bc39bc56bb831116df44f6f550cb.avif?t=1760304425\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st